[{"title":"折尾滩祀张桓侯庙有作 其二","author":"金科豫","text":"岩顶烟云郁不开，江间波浪吼如雷。\n从今寄语操舟者，不必仍前对我来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11122,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"白帝城怀古","author":"金科豫","text":"昭烈祠堂近水滨，帝城西望莽荆榛。\n千秋遗恨悲荒燹，六尺宏谟托老臣。\n延汉有心天不祚，复雠无愧义终申。\n至令身后街亭役，犹使英雄泣识人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11123,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"武侯八阵碛叠前韵","author":"金科豫","text":"纵横八阵古江滨，岁久空堤长绿榛。\n鞭石犹堪供汉役，望氛应早怯吴臣。\n声传万马机先伏，气夺三军志自申。\n留镇云安三峡水，年年风雨泣神人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11124,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新滩","author":"金科豫","text":"传闻天圣中，山崩归峡口。\n江波潺湲逆不流，断巘离披纷厄纽。\n行人无计达重渊，帆樯坐困迷津久。\n迨历皇祐三年初，都官员外膺简书。\n用工累月殚全力，疏通未尽遗崎岖。\n至今鸡肝突江面，孤峰转向奔涛战。\n掀天白浪竞喧豗，扁舟直下疾如箭。\n随风旋折临飞渱，山鸣谷应声漴漴。\n回湍左右势激荡，簸扬一叶轻飘蓬。\n二滩三滩复在望，鲸鲵怒捲遥相向。\n榜人大叫声力俱，一挥掉破连天浪。\n噫嚱危乎蜀道难，冲破逆折如云攒。\n沦没倏忽固天命，使人对此生悲叹。\n君不见益州刺史晋杨亮，使君滩下神怏怅。\n万里艰辛奉命来，几将忠血埋寒涨。\n我行正值朔风凄，满山雪压猿猱啼。\n布帆遥指幸无恙，姊归有客相招携。\n满斟黄柑且痛饮，一任江声汨汨吼空堤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11125,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雪际登黄鹤楼","author":"金科豫","text":"朔雪满江上，频登黄鹤楼。\n连樯迷鄂渚，冥雾失鹦洲。\n高挹天花落，寒飘玉蕊稠。\n白云仍在望，临眺意悠悠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11126,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏游平山堂 其一","author":"金科豫","text":"画舫轻摇淡荡中，水波不动任西东。\n我来正值春光暮，花信犹馀第几风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11127,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏游平山堂 其二","author":"金科豫","text":"虹园花木倚云栽，芍药含红半未开。\n惆怅清和晴复雨，几番辜负好楼台。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11128,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏游平山堂 其三","author":"金科豫","text":"画楼流影焕天街，檀板笙簧处处皆。\n一曲铜鞮歌旧事，游人争说小秦淮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11129,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏游平山堂 其四","author":"金科豫","text":"冶春词社旧知名，想像当年四座倾。\n五日东风十日雨，诗成随处谱歌声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11130,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏游平山堂 其五","author":"金科豫","text":"杨柳依依翠作湾，每从深处听绵蛮。\n笙歌满地知多少，扰我诗肠句也悭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11131,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏游平山堂 其六","author":"金科豫","text":"平山堂畔绿阴多，笼罩晴辉漾素波。\n为问当年双细柳，可还依旧晒鱼蓑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11132,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏游平山堂 其七","author":"金科豫","text":"镇日优游载酒行，催归斜照半山横。\n莺声不解留人醉，廿四桥头空月明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11133,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏游平山堂 其八","author":"金科豫","text":"细细歌声处处通，夜船灯火半江红。\n随风掩映波光里，多少楼台月影中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11134,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟居","author":"金科豫","text":"舟居苦逼窄，溽暑相侵虐。\n中天驭火轮，赫赫悲爇燋。\n煽炙水沸腾，气热殷汤镬。\n咫尺几席间，眠坐两难著。\n纨摇腕力疲，汗湿身衣缚。\n痴蝇逐不开，扑面恣飞掠。\n长昼愈绵绵，萦缠方寸恶。\n推篷眄远村，绿树纷交错。\n心驰足欲随，境隔情空托。\n岂无舶趠风，吹来温似灼。\n安得雨如绳，系彼火云脚。\n飘凉遍宇中，顿使炎威却。\n心期一笑开，趺坐资情酌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11135,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨际晚眺 其一","author":"金科豫","text":"远树蝉声歇，空堤燕影忙。\n篷窗閒徙倚，消受水风凉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11136,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨际晚眺 其二","author":"金科豫","text":"细雨浸莎岸，人家半掩扉。\n隔溪垂钓者，犹自待船归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11137,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"八关中即事","author":"金科豫","text":"南北流通细细潮，金门低锁浪痕消。\n水当曲折迂偏急，帆转湾回近却遥。\n红荻花繁殷极浦，绿杨烟重亸长条。\n随风最喜鸣蝉意，次第声传破寂寥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11138,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月夜泊汶上道中","author":"金科豫","text":"深宵寂寂减朱炎，野阔风凉露气沾。\n两岸清歌蛙鼓吹，一痕新月玉钩镰。\n灯明林隙孤村远，浪打船头晚涨添。\n转侧无眠城畔路，柝声敲碎夜更严。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11139,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"立秋","author":"金科豫","text":"绿树垂堤映水流，一天阴雨报新秋。\n凉飘金井梧初堕，高挹铜盘露乍浮。\n风静钲声传甲马，夜深云影望牵牛。\n宵馀检点途中景，得有清光几斛收。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11140,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新秋舟行玩月","author":"金科豫","text":"西风渐飒飒，林木声萧萧。\n白云起四野，舒卷凌层宵。\n天高气澄淡，夜寂生清寥。\n新蟾时露影，素练横空飘。\n流光彻榛樾，凉意薄轻绡。\n殷勤发远瞩，依稀辨斗杓。\n人家隔阡陌，明灭灯光遥。\n行行过夜半，月落停双桡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11141,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日书怀赠萧张二刺史张公讳能祐号济庵丁酉选拔四川人】 其一","author":"金科豫","text":"纷纷宦迹各天涯，此际相逢惜岁华。\n犹忆东风啼睍睆，忽惊秋水赋蒹葭。\n思莼漫拟邻张翰，落帽何须笑孟嘉。\n就里谁耽陶令癖，炉烟香静对黄花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11142,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日书怀赠萧张二刺史张公讳能祐号济庵丁酉选拔四川人】 其二","author":"金科豫","text":"十年吏最著清勤，流誉燕都处处闻。\n忽向天南歌作牧，恐教冀北叹空群。\n文章养到思成锦，肝胆交深义薄云。\n镇日追随春座里，高言频挹惠风薰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11143,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日书怀赠萧张二刺史张公讳能祐号济庵丁酉选拔四川人】 其三","author":"金科豫","text":"七二衡峰忆旧游，输君政治独风流。\n一庭讼静堪罗雀，万卷书成欲汗牛。\n芒部新声棠荫永，锦囊佳句茧丝抽。\n峨眉伊昔多钟秀，除却髯苏未许俦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11144,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日书怀赠萧张二刺史张公讳能祐号济庵丁酉选拔四川人】 其四","author":"金科豫","text":"尊酒论心臭味同，夜深犹共话离衷。\n快谈且尽窗西烛，底事休虞塞北翁。\n千里金兰萍迹外，九秋风月雁声中。\n无端邂逅成佳会，记取燕山潞水东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11145,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登文昌阁","author":"金朝觐","text":"雨后登高阁，春城树色鲜。\n流云滋晓润，恰好试新笺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11146,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送徐栗斋之任义州","author":"金朝觐","text":"拜命陪京令望奢，九重恩诏帝深嘉。\n鼎钟旧勒三岑绩，雨露新沾一县花。\n化屦何年凫有迹，垂帘尽日鹤排衙。\n东风远送旌旗路，为锡龙章荷宠嘉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11147,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登翠岩山","author":"金朝觐","text":"云山飘渺共低迷，万木青葱入望齐。\n直欲举头天外看，红尘隔断数峰西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11148,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望梳妆楼","author":"金朝觐","text":"栖霞仙子驻龙斿，为近天关筑玉楼。\n晓镜开奁初日动，晚妆拂袖暮云流。\n目凝淩水波同媚，髻拥虹螺翠共浮。\n岩畔苔钱纷五色，遗钿疑是未曾收。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11149,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿山房","author":"金朝觐","text":"鸡报空林正五更，晓风潇洒六尘清。\n山房曾否黄粱熟，梦醒晨钟第一声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11150,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望笔架山","author":"金朝觐","text":"三丫倚汉峙双双，望若惊人意欲降。\n合遣沧溟成墨沈，巨灵擎笔大如杠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11151,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"锦州道上","author":"金朝觐","text":"夙志壮山河，皇舆万象罗。\n露华融旭日，海气羃虹螺。\n树锁村烟密，花迎鸟语和。\n农桑通岛屿，樵牧唱岩阿。\n怅别三秋远，愁吟一字多。\n殷勤前路去，消息竟如何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11152,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卢峰口怀古","author":"金朝觐","text":"茂草丰林万壑阴，将军射虎尚雄心。\n封侯不遂羞刀笔，饮羽何如饮恨深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11153,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"沙河驿","author":"金朝觐","text":"微雨轻风接轸过，驿亭烟树绕沙河。\n连朝渐觉乡音异，来路云山天际多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11154,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别山戏题","author":"金朝觐","text":"故园别业别离久，别去东风别恨长。\n别路感怀牵别绪，别人道出别山阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11155,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"挽于烈妇即依原韵","author":"金朝觐","text":"哀鸳何事最关心，今忆前言悟后因。\n月转蕙帏空对影，鸾飞菱镜自怜身。\n百年世事魂犹殢，三月春光梦未真。\n无限伤情诗一首，闺中亦有读书人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11156,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中秋日闱中忆友","author":"金朝觐","text":"忆昔立风檐，搴帘逢好友。\n谯楼月二更，令我空回首。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11157,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒尹文端公墓","author":"金朝觐","text":"相业昭青简，佳城气郁苍。\n山灵生肃意，碑纪焕奎光。\n一代文章钜，三朝世德彰。\n紫荆朝旭日，髣髴在吾乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11158,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀人","author":"金朝觐","text":"咫尺天涯望里春，含情脉脉独伤神。\n东风一去无消息，巫峡閒云不恋人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11159,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望海","author":"金朝觐","text":"海气淩晨炫远眸，洪波无际只平浮。\n天涯渺渺难推步，地势茫茫有尽头。\n云雨蔚蒸宏润泽，江河归宿混源流。\n伊谁不为临崖返，便信蓬莱定可求。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11160,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"锦州城南","author":"金朝觐","text":"旧堡新村入望遐，太平风景是田家。\n征途络绎通畿辅，农事经营到海涯。\n初夏小苗犹待雨，前朝折戟尚沈沙。\n堪怜牧竖浑无事，短发垂垂带野花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11161,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"留都","author":"金朝觐","text":"鼎建襄平大业隆，留都犹有旧时宫。\n三千化宇风云会，十二重楼烟雨中。\n天柱峰峦群拱北，土门江水尽朝东。\n太平应绘豳风什，伫待銮舆效祝嵩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11162,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与孙宝三言海上之胜","author":"金朝觐","text":"有客居南海，寥寥放眼空。\n听潮多夜气，长啸起天风。\n大泽群流纳，沧波万古同。\n请看奔放者，终障百川东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11163,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次尚铁峰纸鸢元韵 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"九万鹏程笑楚鸠，扶摇直欲白云游。\n天池消息东风便，燕雀相从恨末由。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11164,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次尚铁峰纸鸢元韵 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"天乐临城听有声，洪钟鲸吼藉风鸣。\n调音合向师涓问，休比邻家赵女筝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11165,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答尚铁峰见访不遇","author":"金朝觐","text":"余本寻春客，君为入幕宾。\n当门题午字，谁是会心人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11166,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"瀛洲仙馆文宴","author":"金朝觐","text":"三月春阑近晚和，吟馀恰有客来过。\n沈酣书味甘醇醴，飒爽词锋出太阿。\n畏友之前浮气少，英年而后世情多。\n那堪回首长安道，几向秋风唤奈何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11167,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"金朝觐","text":"虚堂春昼寂，棋子响丁然。\n如有机心在，相争孰后先。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11168,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟古意","author":"金朝觐","text":"轩厂临风爽，帘疏受月明。\n伊人期未至，惆怅不胜情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11169,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"见富厚庵寄内之作戏题","author":"金朝觐","text":"南亩犹勤馌，东郊尚晚春。\n如何蚕未老，不见采桑人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11170,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虞美人花","author":"金朝觐","text":"倚阑䰀鬌坠烟鬟，无奈销魂去不还。\n千古无穷垓下恨，朝朝零露泣红颜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11171,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与书华峰浑河垂钓","author":"金朝觐","text":"浑河滚滚来从东，大木浮出万山中。\n水深巨鱼不亲岸，兴波鼓浪吹腥风。\n华峰睹此忽技痒，计作长绳约百丈。\n屈铁为钩饵以甘，抛向中流试穷想。\n昨者筮得贯鱼占，今逢独丝钓鳌詹。\n须臾衔索势将去，欲取姑与聊伏潜。\n忽闻泼刺转骇绝，鳞甲激扬互明灭。\n饥鹰苦羁黄金绦，驽马怒啮白玉埒。\n蛟龙失水犹蜿蜒，何况凡鳞出重渊。\n力敝已为人所制，目动吻张摇尾怜。\n君不见西畔投竿落日边，得鱼盈寸喜忘筌，我得其一抵百千。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11172,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和洪樗庵渡浑河望见沈阳元韵","author":"金朝觐","text":"迢迢深树隐城隅，秋色人家俨画图。\n一路檀车徵旧典，几将名胜入清旴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11173,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄铁峰书题后一首","author":"金朝觐","text":"寒鸡啼五夜，晓色淡秋河。\n一自君归后，阶前落叶多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11174,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠朝鲜使臣高二首 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"惆怅三春别，殷勤此日逢。\n作宾偕旅雁，利见卜飞龙。\n官纪存遗制，藩篱守旧封。\n皇华端不愧，谁解此情钟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11175,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠朝鲜使臣高二首 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"佳气普寰中，人文蔚海东。\n休和群沐泽，小大尽从公。\n玉帛通王会，衣冠寓古风。\n贤劳千里外，珍重此葵衷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11176,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送李学山一首","author":"金朝觐","text":"秋色櫹椮动客情，一窗晴日数归程。\n相知千里何寥落，从事天涯弟与兄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11177,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠金清山一首","author":"金朝觐","text":"海邦络绎幸来宾，应识新罗旧有人。\n故国不堪回首处，岭南遗绪亦藩臣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11178,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送朴慈庵二首 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"神仙何必尽虚无，海外奇方亦不诬。\n遂有薪传兼尔雅，多缘仁术重吾儒。\n宏开寿宇肱三折，静养慈庵杏五株。\n自是为医犹作相，谁从市上觅悬壶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11179,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送朴慈庵二首 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"偏因知遇易暌违，鞭影斜阳马上挥。\n西土好音成别绪，东医宝鉴嗣前徽。\n如君肝胆风尘少，异地关山雨雪霏。\n最是离愁医不得，拟将远志寄当归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11180,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长宁寺迎銮恭纪","author":"金朝觐","text":"糺缦五云红，曈昽映大东。\n明昭天日表，肃穆圣神衷。\n河岳趋宸跸，旌旗仰下风。\n欢声同四野，应彻九重宫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11181,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"恭迎皇上驾幸学宫","author":"金朝觐","text":"□星晓辟正临雍，紫禁鸣銮出九重。\n作睹文明皆虎豹，升香典礼属夔龙。\n泮芹萦水云霞动，坛杏朝天雨露浓。\n欣际岐阳钟鼓化，小臣何幸备趋从。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11182,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"大清门谢恩","author":"金朝觐","text":"星月荧辉宫漏鸣，千官济济已朝盈。\n遗规丰沛思源本，清奏箫韶和圣明。\n翔凤楼前双阙迥，飞龙阁外五云平。\n嵩呼应入深宫听，不数流莺绕禁城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11183,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送洪樗庵回朝鲜","author":"金朝觐","text":"轻云薄雾净长空，邸舍惊心八月中。\n客梦醒归黄叶路，秋声吹入绿江风。\n行旌指点三湘雁，旅馆清寒四壁虫。\n明月不殊乡国异，几回翘首大瀛东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11184,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送吉凤翔回都二首 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"客意速归程，寒烟晓月明。\n教余时努力，无复问君平。\n辽海远无垠，萍踪寄一身。\n问君来此地，得友几多人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11185,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送吉凤翔回都二首 其二 拟游仙体","author":"金朝觐","text":"洞府深沈寂不闻，閒花野草自纷纷。\n痴情最是仙家犬，不附青云吠白云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11186,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"留示同人","author":"金朝觐","text":"梅花著色未求工，耐得孤寒质不同。\n谁把春光先泄漏，可将消息问东风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11187,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜旅怀","author":"金朝觐","text":"青灯犹灿五更阑，倚枕孤眠梦未安。\n明月自来窗欲晓，秋声何处树号寒。\n归心已似飞蓬转，旅况还如落叶单。\n起视黄花怜独瘦，霜华昨夜满栏干。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11188,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"十二月祗谒祖墓","author":"金朝觐","text":"东山佳气霭重重，远接村庐树色浓。\n裕后有资皆世泽，当前何处想音容。\n春温秋肃惊霜露，鸟语花香侑鼎钟。\n谡谡松声风定后，遗音似祝大夫封。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11189,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]